      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Needs to feature 2 options in settings:\n\nOre-load worlds - (on/off)\n\nWhen user accepts invite preload starts, followed by notification you can join, just like when instances are full.\n\nDirectly join when preload is complete - (on/off)\n\nFor people that do not wanna open the menu again every time to press join, but just automatically switch into the world.",
