      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62e263f7d4627944b9a16d0c|full_name}: >>Directly join when preload is complete - (on/off)\n\nNot bad!\n\nBut if you've joined a VRChat world queue, you have 60 seconds to join or you have to queue back up. I like this idea too, because spontaneously leaving would be kinda jerky.",
