  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since preloading worlds is underway, preloading worlds would be a handy method. However, if you're invited to another world by a user, it would be awesome to preload that world too. Then have a follow-up notification page you, allowing you to join when the world is ready -- much like VRChat's queue system.\n\nIt would be nice to have an extra button on the invite notification screen. Either the button can show where your invite response options are, or fall within the [···] button where more options are selected.",
